AV  - Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, New Jersey Institute of Technology, Newark, NJ, 07102, USA.; Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, New Jersey Institute of Technology, Newark, NJ, 07102, USA.; Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, Drexel University, Philadelphia, PA, 19104, USA.; Penn Fertility Care, Hospital of the University of Pennsylvania, Philadelphia, PA, 19104, USA.; Ovation Fertility, Brentwood, TN, 37027, USA.; Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering, New Jersey Institute of Technology, Newark, NJ, 07102, USA. Kam@njit.edu.
